  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Just minutes from Seaside and the Gulf, 35 Suzanne Drive offers a serene and stylish retreat for families and friends. With a private pool and spa, outdoor fireplace, custom putting green, and six adult bikes included, this pet-friendly Seagrove Beach home combines luxury, comfort, and convenience along 30A.<br><br>Highlights:<br>- Custom Private Putting Green<br>- Pet-Friendly Home (Additional Fee Applies)<br>- 6 Adult Bikes Included in Rental<br>- Parking for 4 Vehicles<br>- Natural Gas Grill<br>- Private Pool with Spa (Complimentary Pool Heating Available October 1–May 1)<br>- Outdoor Fireplace<br>- Exterior Shower<br>- Quick Walk to the Beach<br>- 6-Minute Bike Ride to Seaside<br><br>Welcome to 35 Suzanne Drive, where classic coastal architecture meets modern luxury. Shiplap walls, scraped hardwood floors, and bright natural light create an inviting atmosphere throughout this beautifully designed, pet-friendly home.<br><br>The open-concept main living area flows seamlessly from the kitchen to the dining and living spaces. The gourmet kitchen features premium appliances, including an oversized Sub-Zero refrigerator, Thermador double gas stove and oven, Dacor microwave, and separate ice maker. The expansive island provides the perfect gathering space for meals and conversation, while the adjoining living area offers comfortable seating and a large flat-screen TV.<br><br>Each bedroom includes a private bathroom and wall-mounted television, ensuring convenience and privacy for every guest. A built-in bunk room provides a fun and practical space for children or additional guests.<br><br>Step outside to enjoy exceptional outdoor living with multiple covered porches, an outdoor fireplace, impressive private putting green, and saltwater pool with spa. Whether you're sipping morning coffee on the porch, challenging the family to a putting contest, or unwinding with an evening swim, this home delivers relaxation and recreation in equal measure.<br><br>Perfectly located near the beach and Seaside's restaurants and shops, 35 Suzanne Drive provides easy access to all that 30A has to offer, making it the ideal pet-friendly destination for your next coastal getaway.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
